    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今はこれと言って思い当たる人はいないけど\r\n俺にも苦手な人のひとりやふたりはいるだろうし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004019020210,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "プロデューサーらしかね\r\n────うちは苦手～とか感じたことなかと",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401902/2004019020210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004019020220,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "やけん、どがん気持ちかわからんくて……",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401902/2004019020220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだったのか\r\nでも、それは恋鐘の良いところだし、俺は尊敬してる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004019020230,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ふぇ……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401902/2004019020230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それに、苦手ってことは相手を強く意識している証拠だし\r\nそこから好きに転じることもあると思うぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004019020240,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "……？\r\n苦手かとが好きになる～？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401902/2004019020240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、人の感情は日々変化するものだから\r\nあまりそれに振り回されなくてもいいんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004019020250,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "なるほど～",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401902/2004019020250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004019020260,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "プロデューサーのおかげで元気の出たばい\r\nありがとう～",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401902/2004019020260"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
